One item on this: A reminder that network passwords expire on a 60-day cycl=
e. You will be prompted at next sign-in. Passwords may not be reused across=
 the last twelve cycles and may not be stored in a browser. Contact the ser=
vice desk if you are locked out; the desk cannot reset a password without c=
allback verification. Let me know if anything looks off.